{"id": "EUVD-2026-86637", "enisaUuid": "c4435665-6c2f-31fa-a04b-450b76fae7b6", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nvduse: return compat ioctl results directly\n\nThe compat handler handles VDUSE_IOTLB_GET_FD and VDUSE_VQ_GET_INFO, but\nthen calls the native handler. Their different command sizes make native\ndispatch return -ENOIOCTLCMD.\n\nFor GET_FD, this overwrites receive_fd()'s return value after the\ndescriptor is installed, leaking one fd per call. Return handled compat\nresults directly and use native dispatch only for other commands.", "datePublished": "2026-09-25T10:23:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:11:50", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/135ac58097fa5fc707bf392c5cececf59e4080c0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/48a4ee65e677559776349128e6a81a6041986c99"], "aliases": ["GHSA-qqc3-34rp-574r", "CVE-2026-97983"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3983dcd7-f74a-396a-855f-8484cf1533cb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "455a2a1af92651764e9eb42cec0d95ac142afc28 <48a4ee65e677559776349128e6a81a6041986c99"}, {"id": "5447a223-ae2a-3936-bf50-b1bbd1718919", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "9c7b0aa0-0e9e-37e3-919e-32e03d198997", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "455a2a1af92651764e9eb42cec0d95ac142afc28 <135ac58097fa5fc707bf392c5cececf59e4080c0"}, {"id": "a0e53116-a7d7-3057-aee7-1fa3c42f3fff", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "a91c3c37-b612-3f98-af0f-7757182e8c6d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.1.5 <7.2"}, {"id": "be05a1bb-758e-3f1a-a7e2-7ec4287a1ac6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.7"}, {"id": "fa4823be-c9f9-32f8-b975-a6f5f6c38899", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7dd28904c42ee3b0728c0692dd3332c2c83e8f33"}, {"id": "fe153f21-c869-3f48-b610-4d3a14d33cde", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3e09f5fd-2f91-3198-b00a-3827573241c1", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}